OL,3,GNEWSACoastal path sign that sent
OL,4,Amillions on their way up for auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe South West Coast Path welcomes nine
OL,7,Fmillion walkers a year - and the start
OL,8,Fof the journey in Somerset has been
OL,9,Fmarked by a simple wooden post for
OL,10,Fdecades.
OL,12,FThe fingerpost in Minehead tells
OL,13,Fwalkers heading on their way that it is
OL,14,F629.75 miles to where the path ends in
OL,15,FPoole Harbour, Dorset.
OL,17,FBut now this overlooked, simple piece
OL,18,Fof history could soon be swapping
OL,19,FMinehead seafront for someone's home -
OL,20,Fas it is has been taken down by Exmoor
OL,21,FNational Park and replaced, and is set
OL,22,Fto go under the hammer.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
