OL,3,GNEWSACoastal path sign that sent
OL,4,Amillions on their way up for auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FGraham Eaves, 72, who is on his ninth
OL,7,Ftraversal of the route, said the
OL,8,Fsignpost in question helped with the
OL,9,Fexcitement of the journey and he was
OL,10,Fconsidering making a bid for it.
